{{- /* Zellij's own `status-bar` plugin, pinned to the bottom of every tab.

     zjstatus at the top carries the mode badge, tabs, host, session and clock;
     this pair of rows is the stock key-hint table for the mode you are in. It
     is the discoverability half of decision #42 — and because it ships with
     Zellij it is rendered from the live keybinding table, so unlike a
     hand-written hint string it cannot drift from the keys it describes.

     Two rows is what the plugin draws: the Ctrl layer, then the mode's own
     keys. Included by every layout after `children`, so the bar cannot differ
     between them. */ -}}
        pane size=2 borderless=true {
            plugin location="zellij:status-bar"
        }
